    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「……おっと、電話だわさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「もしも～し？　山條ぎんちゃんだわさっ♪　どちら様～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あぁ、誰かと思えば『図書室』の。あんた、何で電話かけてくるたびに番号が変わるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「底知れないねぇ、どうせ今回も裏から手ぇ回してるんでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは☆　あんた好みの、とっても楽しい『物語』が展開してるよ～う？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あんたも、どっかで見てるんでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「とはいえ、あんたみたいに傍観者を気取るには……。この山條ぎんちゃん、若すぎるっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは☆　無意味に大暴れしちゃおっかな～、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「屋上に出入りしてる子たちもけっこう関わってるみたいだし♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「お～？　珍しく電話かけてきたと思ったら、『そういう用件』？」"
